; src/stdlib/math.nx — the constants of the `nexis.math` namespace
; (docs/TOOLING.md §4). The functions (sqrt, pow, floor, ceil,
; round) are natives in src/stdlib.zig `math_natives`; abs lives in
; nexis.core. Embedded via @embedFile and bootstrapped at VM startup
; with nexis.math as the current namespace.

(def PI 3.141592653589793)
(def E 2.718281828459045)
